# VQ1 deployment artifacts — tracked despite the patterns above.
# Added by refactor/deduplicate-root-subdir: these are load-bearing
# for test_dcl_adapter.py and for any fresh clone that wants to run
# the adapter end-to-end. Other trained*/ dirs (historical runs,
# stored only in drone-race-sim/) remain ignored.
!trained_distilled/
!trained_distilled/**
!models_release/*.zip

